menu "CTF hardware track"

    config CTF_HW_DEV
        bool "HW track dev self-test (prints derived values)"
        default n
        help
            Adds the `hwdev` console command: prints the per-board PWM
            frequency (and measures it with PCNT), the touch code, touch raw
            readings and samples the Morse LED. For testing only; release
            builds must keep this off.

endmenu
